  "title": {
   "en": "Phantom Limb"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "*Featured on MangaPlus for securing the Silver Award/1st place in the Medibang MangaPlus Creators Monthly Prize*\n\nThe Phantom Limb is a phenomenon like no other.\n\nPlagued by horrible visions, Jacob hires a pair of paranormal investigators: Gheist and Jackie. Gheist is a brick wall of a man, a cloud of smoke about him. Jackie, on the other hand, is a timid boy with a missing arm. As the pair search the haunted apartment, they might uncover more than just a supernatural opponent...",
   "es-la": "La Extremidad Fantasma es un fenómeno sin igual. Atormentado por espantosas visiones, Jacob recurre a dos investigadores paranormales: Gheist y Jackie. Gheist es un hombre imponente, siempre envuelto en una nube de humo. Jackie, en cambio, es un muchacho tímido que carece de un brazo. Pero mientras exploran el apartamento encantado, podrían descubrir algo más que una simple presencia sobrenatural..."
  },
